```javascript
function debounce(fn, delayMs) {
  let timer;
  return function (...args) {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn.apply(this, args), delayMs);
  };
}
```

Each call resets the timer, so `fn` runs only after `delayMs` ms without new calls.

